    "description": {
      "en": "Original low-poly direction: establish short oval barrel with repeated triple comb bands and flattened poles in the blockout, then preserve the largest silhouette breaks and openings. Simplify fine ornament and repeated elements without copying reference meshes; palette and presentation are artistic choices, not fossil evidence.",
      "zh": "原创低多边形方向：先以短椭圆桶体两端较平，具有重复三联栉带搭建体块，再保留主要外轮廓转折与孔隙。细纹及重复结构可简化，不复制参考网格；配色与展示方式属于美术选择，并非化石证据。"
