    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism interpretation: short ovoid barrel with relatively flat poles, eight groups of three broad comb bands, shorter middle bands and converging aboral strands, plus a small conservative aboral capsule. Repeated broad plates express coarse hierarchy without microscopic cilia. Opaque muted sea-green palette and nominal 0.055 m height are artistic choices. No jellyfish bell, tentacle curtain, feeding mechanism, transparency physics or exact preserved cell-count claim. Closed comb parts sit partly embedded in the continuous body surface.",
      "zh": "原创全身生活复原：两端较平的短卵桶体、八组三联宽栉带、较短中央列与向反口端会聚的条带，并保守表现小型反口端囊状结构。重复宽片只表达粗层次，不表现微纤毛。不透明柔和海绿色与0.055米名义高度为艺术设定。不添加水母钟体或触手幕，不主张摄食机制、透明体物理或精确保存细胞数量。封闭栉片局部嵌入连续体表。"
    },
    "reconstruction_type": "whole-organism",
